---
// Front-door masthead: imprint name and the standing line beneath it.
---

<header class="masthead">
  <h1 class="masthead-name small-caps">As We May Act</h1>
  <p class="masthead-line">Public records in Arkansas, and what to do with them.</p>
</header>

<style>
  .masthead {
    padding-block: 1rem 2rem;
  }

  .masthead-name {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-grotesque);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .masthead-line {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-text);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink-light);
  }
</style>
